      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HILLBILLY TIGER (2) is a first starter from the Michael Hendy kennel by Aston Rupee out of Merlene. Drawn favourably and can capitalise. Expected to be well fancied and can make an immediate impact. SHADOW ROAD (1) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing fourth (24.85) last time in a Maiden at Bendigo. The form from her last run is stacking up nicely. Must be included in calculations. CALCEUS (7) profiles well for this but has a wide draw to content with at his first outing. Can kick off with a good run. SHAGGY BILLIE (4) is a Jordan Formosa-trained newcomer by Tommy Shelby out of Whodat Opal. No favours with the draw and will need to begin well. Can run a bold race on debut.",
